Topic was a monster is blocking a boulder in Sokoban -
How to kill it?  That answer was to throw stuff at it.

I suggest throwing items less valuable than daggers.
The daggers will stay in the square and the blouder
will bury them.  Then you will be faced with digging
them up and having a pit in your way in the corridor
heading to the up stairs or leaving behind valuable
items.  Daggers can end up extremely valuable in the
long run.

So consider throwing rocks and/or projectiles you do
not intend to use later in the game.  If you are not
interested in a bow or crossbows, arrows and bolts
will do fine.  Rocks are the most plentifull
ammunition in the game so if you lose a few dozen it
doesn't matter.  Rocks aren't worth digging a pit for.


